          "label": "Investigation 1 reflection",
          "prompt": "What evidence from The Hook matters most to your investigation?",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "sensitivity": "P2",
          "required": true,
          "placeholder": "Write what you actually noticed…"
        }
      ]
    },
